The '''Mead Ketill''' is a crafting station used to prepare [[mead]] bases. It requires a fire source underneath to operate, such as a [[campfire]] or [[hearth]].

The Mead Ketill has no upgrades. All recipes are accessible at station level 1.

Mead bases must be fermented using a [[Fermenter]] to produce consumable meads.

