==Trivia==
* The Mead Ketill was added in [[version history|The Bog Witch update]]. Previously, Mead Bases were crafted at the [[Cauldron]].
* Besides mead bases, it is used to craft Oat Milk. Its ingredients require accessing the Deep North, but due to the Mead Ketill's lack of upgrades, it can be produced as soon as the [[Windmill]] is available (after defeating [[Moder]]).

